      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/McGrath%2C_Alaska",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "After a 1933 flood, residents moved across the river, leaving the old site on a slough and making it unusable.",
